# Supa Odds — fixtures are REAL via ESPN with no key (hybrid mode). A free
# odds key below unlocks full multi-book prices (DraftKings etc.); without
# it, soccer is priced and US leagues show as fixtures awaiting prices.
#
# 1. Sign up free at https://the-odds-api.com/ (500 requests/mo, no card)
# 2. Copy .env.example to .env and paste your key below
# 3. Run: npm run bot:fetch            (one live pull)
#    or:  npm run dev:all              (site + auto-refresh loop)
#
# Quota tips (free plan is small):
#   npm run bot:fetch -- --only epl,nba          (2 leagues ≈ 4 req/run)
#   npm run bot:watch -- --interval-min 60       (hourly loop instead of 5-min)
# A full 10-league tick costs ~20 requests (odds + scores per league).
ODDS_API_KEY=
# Optional: same key with Vite prefix if you want client-side experiments (bot uses server key above)
# VITE_ODDS_API_KEY=

# ---- MTN MoMo (Pro checkout goes live) ----
# 1. Free sandbox signup: https://momodeveloper.mtn.com/ (no money moves)
# 2. Provision an API user for Collections, paste the three values below
# 3. node bot/momo.js --check   (verifies)
# 4. Production = MTN approval (registered business) + hosted callback URL.
# Until then /pro runs in DEMO and no real cedis move.
# MOMO_BASE=https://sandbox.momodeveloper.mtn.com
# MOMO_USER_ID=
# MOMO_API_KEY=
# MOMO_SUB_KEY=
# MOMO_ENV=sandbox
# MOMO_CALLBACK=https://your-server.example/momo/callback

# ---- Paystack (Route B — recommended) ----
# 1. Free signup: https://dashboard.paystack.com/ (Ghana supported)
# 2. Copy a TEST secret key below, run: npm run pay:server
# 3. Checkout at /pro talks to http://localhost:8787 (set VITE_PAY_API below to change)
# 4. Test with Paystack's test MoMo numbers, then KYC for LIVE keys.
# PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# PAY_PORT=8787
# VITE_PAY_API=http://localhost:8787
